# Local editor / internal notes (not part of the published extension)
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md

# Every piece of working material now lives in one place: the agent rules and
# guidelines, the journals and memories, the tooling research and the business
# thinking. One directory rule rather than a path per file — the old list named
# five paths, and a sixth file dropped beside them would have gone to a public
# remote with nobody noticing. That was not hypothetical:
# `docs/AI_TOOLING_RESEARCH.md`, `MONETIZATION.md` and `BUSINESS_IDEAS.md` were
# protected only by this clone's `.git/info/exclude`, which no fresh clone has.
#
# They are checkpoint EXTRA_PATHS, so a snapshot still holds them: ignored
# means "not part of the shipped history", not "disposable".
docs/internal/
MONETIZATION.md
BUSINESS_IDEAS.md

